  "name": "Risk of Loss Rating Assistant",
  "description": "An agent that analyzes multiple talent signals across a manager’s direct reports—such as performance goals, development goals, feedback, check-ins, performance documents, career potential, and existing risk-of-loss indicators—to identify trends and recommend updates to risk-of-loss ratings for proactive retention planning.",
